\includegraphics[width=0.9\columnwidth]{Fig2.pdf}
\caption{\label{fig:2} Noise measurement results for the LD-Ta VNJ with $L = 8$~nm. (a) Noise vs $V_B$, at the labeled $T$. Curves: fittings with Eq.~(\ref{eq:SN_general}). (b) $F$ vs $T$. Curve: fitting as described in the text. (c) $B$ vs $T$. Line is a guide for the eye. (d) $B$ vs $F$. The line if a linear fit with zero intercept.}
