  \caption{A geodesic triangle in a $\delta$-hyperbolic graph. 
           The shaded corridor of width~$\delta$ shows that each side stays within distance $\delta$ of the union of the other two. This shaded region shows the tree-like geometry that initiates our
           boundary-weighted filter.}
