	$$\sum_{k=1}^{n}\frac{1}{k}\sum_{j=1}^{k}\frac{H_j}{j}.$$
	Let $F_0=\bQ(x)$ with $\sigma(x)=x+1$ and take the $\Sigma^*$-tower $F_2=F_0(t_1,t_2)$ over $F_0$, where 
