Observing that $\Delta(E_i)$ is a $C$-subspace of $F_i$ we get the following connection.


\begin{corollary}
$\phi_i|_{E_i}$ is a complete reduction of $\Delta(E_i)$ on $E_i$ for $1\leq i\leq n$. 
\end{corollary}
