 we conclude that $\phi'_i(f)\in \bigoplus_{i\in \bN} \im(\phi_{i-1}')t^i$ by Corollary~\ref{COR:remainder}.2. Thus $\phi'_i(f)\in E_i$ and it follows that $g\in F_i\setminus E_i$ such that $f=\Delta(g)+\phi'_i(f)$. However, $\Delta(g)=f-\phi'_i(f)\in E_i$. With~\cite[Thm.~2.7]{Schneider:2010} we conclude that $g\in E_i$, a contradiction. 
