Looking at Eqs. (\ref{formMoy}) and (\ref{formeCov}), we see that functions $\g{m}$ and $\g{C}$ only depend on $\mathbb{E}\Cr{\widehat{\g{\beta}}^{\text{tot}}}$, $\text{Cov}\PP{\widehat{\g{\beta}}^{\text{tot}}}$ and $\mathbb{E}\Cr{\widehat{\g{\Theta}}\widehat{\g{\Theta}}^T}$, which can again be approximated using a bootstrap procedure as it is done in \ref{appendixA}.

